id: dense-plating
name: Dense Plating
order: 1
optionOf: survivor
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Soak Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.
text: >
  Dense Plating [Passive]: Increase your Soak Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.

---

# The Plating's Apparel Bonus - nothing while it is Inactive (actor-character.mjs naturalArmor).
[passive]
soakValue += ceil(naturalArmor.apparelBonus / 2);
